<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Inacom view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Inacom view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview analyst Tom Cal said he raised his short-term rating on Inacom Corp to buy from hold and increased his earnings estimate for the company's fiscal 1997 year to $2.16 from $2.10 per share previously.</p>
<p>-- In published comments, the analyst said he left his long-term buy rating on the stock unchanged.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
